1
00:00:01,380 --> 00:00:02,920
[MARLEN] This peril
will strengthen the bonds

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,550
between temple and military.

3
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:06,050
And those very bonds

4
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:09,380
will ensure a path to victory
for all humanity.

5
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,050
Well said, Uncle.

6
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:14,850
Your words are inspiring

7
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:17,060
-and I will take them to heart.
-[MARLEN] Hmm.

8
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:20,810
May the blessings
of Saint Mahaeyzel

9
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:22,230
guide and protect us.

10
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:23,360
[Kivia gasps]

11
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:27,400
Now, let the attack commence.

12
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:29,910
[♪ tense music playing]

13
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,240
[Kivia breathes shakily]

14
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:34,620
[whimpers]

15
00:00:34,990 --> 00:00:36,160
[metal rattles]

16
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:38,080
Uncle!

17
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:39,160
[MARLEN] Hmm?

18
00:00:39,670 --> 00:00:41,920
[KIVIA] I'd like to learn more
about our current situation.

19
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,340
Who first reported
there were faeries in the city?

20
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:46,760
Which of the units?

21
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:50,550
Seven one one zero,
Ioff City Defense Force.

22
00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:53,390
A few among them
managed to survive,

23
00:00:53,430 --> 00:00:55,390
but they're in no condition
to talk.

24
00:00:56,680 --> 00:00:58,230
[KIVIA] I would imagine not.

25
00:00:58,770 --> 00:01:00,060
[MARLEN] If that is all.

26
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:03,560
[grunts softly]

27
00:01:03,610 --> 00:01:05,270
[faeries shrieking]

28
00:01:08,110 --> 00:01:09,610
[BOOJUM] They now
have an inroad

29
00:01:09,650 --> 00:01:11,450
through the underground
waterway.

30
00:01:11,490 --> 00:01:14,320
I suppose I should return
to the task at hand.

31
00:01:15,370 --> 00:01:16,910
[thudding]

32
00:01:16,950 --> 00:01:18,660
[faeries growling]

33
00:01:22,540 --> 00:01:24,500
[♪ tense music playing]

34
00:01:25,130 --> 00:01:26,880
[ZOFFLEC] Prepare for combat!

35
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,260
Sniper Captain Siena.

36
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:30,760
Do your best to slow them down.

37
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:34,140
[SIENA] Cavalry Captain Zofflec,
we've got this handled.

38
00:01:35,220 --> 00:01:37,930
Ready? Fire at will!

39
00:01:39,430 --> 00:01:41,020
[faeries shrieking]

40
00:01:42,390 --> 00:01:43,400
[ZOFFLEC] Beautiful!

41
00:01:43,730 --> 00:01:46,730
-[♪ dramatic music playing]
-[faeries growling]

42
00:01:46,770 --> 00:01:48,860
[ZOFFLEC] Our turn!
Scatter them!

43
00:01:48,900 --> 00:01:50,820
-[horses neighing]
-[knights yelling]

44
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,990
[horses neighing]

45
00:01:55,450 --> 00:01:58,160
We'll follow
and take out any foes they miss!

46
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,700
Secure the area!

47
00:01:59,750 --> 00:02:00,790
[KNIGHTS] Yes, sir!

48
00:02:00,830 --> 00:02:02,160
[knights yelling]

49
00:02:03,290 --> 00:02:04,370
That will do.

50
00:02:04,830 --> 00:02:07,920
At least we can entrust
this task the Holy Knights.

51
00:02:09,130 --> 00:02:11,260
Meanwhile, we
must keep investigating

52
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:12,880
Demon Lord Spriggan.

53
00:02:16,850 --> 00:02:19,220
[♪ opening theme song playing]

54
00:03:47,310 --> 00:03:48,900
[faeries growling]

55
00:03:51,570 --> 00:03:52,770
[shrieks]

56
00:03:56,650 --> 00:03:57,910
Tatsuya, go!

57
00:03:58,740 --> 00:04:00,160
-[Tatsuya grunts]
-[faerie growls]

58
00:04:00,870 --> 00:04:01,950
[Tatsuya yells]

59
00:04:04,790 --> 00:04:05,910
[grunts]

60
00:04:08,540 --> 00:04:10,500
[yells fiercely]

61
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,130
[screams]

62
00:04:19,380 --> 00:04:21,550
-[faerie growls]
-[Tatsuya yells]

63
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:23,260
[grunts]

64
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:25,260
-Huh?
-[men gasp]

65
00:04:25,310 --> 00:04:27,560
-[MAN 1] That must be a faerie!
-[MAN 2] A humanoid.

66
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:28,770
[MAN 1] Fighting its own?

67
00:04:28,810 --> 00:04:31,480
We're all human here.
Now open the door.

68
00:04:31,980 --> 00:04:33,110
Human?

69
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:36,070
[MAN 2] That sacred seal.

70
00:04:36,110 --> 00:04:37,650
-He's a penal hero.
-[door thuds]

71
00:04:37,690 --> 00:04:39,030
[XYLO] Let us in already!

72
00:04:39,070 --> 00:04:41,620
The faeries
will summon reinforcements.

73
00:04:41,660 --> 00:04:43,030
You want to live or die?

74
00:04:43,080 --> 00:04:44,280
[men grunt softly]

75
00:04:44,660 --> 00:04:47,330
[XYLO] You'll be easy pickings
hiding in your little shelter.

76
00:04:47,370 --> 00:04:49,580
[TEORITTA] We must utter words
of inspiration.

77
00:04:50,210 --> 00:04:53,250
Civilians, heed my words!

78
00:04:55,420 --> 00:04:56,500
Hmm.

79
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:59,720
Lay down your fear,
for I am the goddess Teoritta.

80
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:01,180
I offer salvation,

81
00:05:01,220 --> 00:05:04,100
thus I must ask you
to follow our lead.

82
00:05:04,140 --> 00:05:05,930
[RHYNO] That's right.
We're here to help.

83
00:05:05,970 --> 00:05:08,730
Your shelter is in a rather
precarious position.

84
00:05:09,230 --> 00:05:11,650
But there's absolutely
no need to worry.

85
00:05:11,690 --> 00:05:13,440
The Shining Goddess of Swords,

86
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:15,940
Teoritta,
and the Thunder Falcon,

87
00:05:15,980 --> 00:05:18,780
Xylo Forbartz,
are here to save the day!

88
00:05:18,820 --> 00:05:21,660
-[MAN 3] She's a goddess?
-[MAN 4] The Thunder Falcon?

89
00:05:21,700 --> 00:05:22,990
[MAN 5] They really exist?

90
00:05:23,030 --> 00:05:25,120
-[XYLO] Knock it off!
-[RHYNO] Whoopsie!

91
00:05:25,660 --> 00:05:27,620
Where'd you hear
about that crap?

92
00:05:27,660 --> 00:05:30,460
[RHYNO] Those rumors managed
to reach even my lonely cell.

93
00:05:30,500 --> 00:05:32,790
You've become something
of a living legend!

94
00:05:32,830 --> 00:05:34,960
-Are you stupid or what?
-Enough, my knight!

95
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,710
Please control your temper.

96
00:05:36,750 --> 00:05:38,800
We are the Shining Goddess
of Swords

97
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:39,760
and the Thunder Falcon!

98
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:41,720
-[Tatsuya grunts]
-How grand.

99
00:05:41,760 --> 00:05:43,220
Our monikers are quite fitting

100
00:05:43,260 --> 00:05:44,930
-for champions of legend.
-[Xylo grunts]

101
00:05:45,470 --> 00:05:46,600
[Tatsuya growls]

102
00:05:47,890 --> 00:05:48,970
[Xylo sighs]

103
00:05:57,270 --> 00:05:58,570
[exhales]

104
00:05:58,610 --> 00:06:01,030
We'll need to prepare them
to defend themselves.

105
00:06:01,570 --> 00:06:04,660
Rhyno, teach them
how to use the lightning staves.

106
00:06:05,450 --> 00:06:07,700
[RHYNO] Of course.
It would be my pleasure.

107
00:06:07,740 --> 00:06:10,200
I'll strive to make you proud,
Comrade Xylo.

108
00:06:10,660 --> 00:06:12,250
If you don't mind,

109
00:06:12,290 --> 00:06:14,040
I'd like your advice
on something.

110
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:15,250
What?

111
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,090
[RHYNO] Which civilians

112
00:06:17,210 --> 00:06:18,880
would make the best
cannon fodder here?

113
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:21,300
-[exclaims] Come again?
-[RHYNO] The elderly

114
00:06:21,340 --> 00:06:24,090
are clearly the most expendable,
don't you think?

115
00:06:24,130 --> 00:06:25,470
They've already had their shot
at life,

116
00:06:25,510 --> 00:06:27,600
which gives them an edge
over the children.

117
00:06:27,640 --> 00:06:30,020
-I'd say the fairest option--
-That's enough.

118
00:06:30,060 --> 00:06:32,770
Don't tell me you really
thought I'd go along with that.

119
00:06:33,190 --> 00:06:34,690
[RHYNO] Huh? Do you view it

120
00:06:34,730 --> 00:06:36,690
as a moral quandary
or some such?

121
00:06:37,190 --> 00:06:39,520
Look, we're here on a mission.

122
00:06:39,570 --> 00:06:41,400
We won't rest
until we've exhausted

123
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:43,150
every possible option.

124
00:06:43,780 --> 00:06:44,910
Losing civilians

125
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:47,490
-is the absolute last resort.
-[faeries growling]

126
00:06:47,530 --> 00:06:49,330
[♪ tense music playing]

127
00:06:52,250 --> 00:06:53,910
Reinforcements already?

128
00:06:54,370 --> 00:06:56,960
[JAYCE] Xylo, still
haven't done your job, eh?

129
00:06:57,880 --> 00:06:59,880
Always a step behind.

130
00:07:00,420 --> 00:07:03,130
It's looking like I'm about
to score another win.

131
00:07:09,970 --> 00:07:11,470
[faeries shriek]

132
00:07:12,850 --> 00:07:14,020
[Neely roars]

133
00:07:14,060 --> 00:07:16,520
[RHYNO] Comrade Jayce!
Comrade Neely!

134
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:18,770
Allow me to thank you
for your brave service

135
00:07:18,810 --> 00:07:20,900
on behalf of our evacuees.

136
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:22,980
Shut your mouth, asshole.

137
00:07:23,860 --> 00:07:25,950
Alright, Dotta. Who's up next?

138
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,990
[DOTTA] Well, about that.

139
00:07:28,490 --> 00:07:30,080
I've got bad news!
There's someone

140
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:32,240
in scary black armor
on the red tower!

141
00:07:33,540 --> 00:07:34,660
[grunts]

142
00:07:34,700 --> 00:07:36,420
Artillery? Neely!

143
00:07:41,590 --> 00:07:43,210
[RHYNO]
They've got tracking shells?

144
00:07:43,260 --> 00:07:45,510
Our dragoon
won't be of much help to us.

145
00:07:45,550 --> 00:07:46,630
[grunts]

146
00:07:46,670 --> 00:07:49,590
Rhyno, I'm taking the fight
to Tui Jia.

147
00:07:49,640 --> 00:07:51,850
You and Tatsuya
protect this warehouse

148
00:07:51,890 --> 00:07:52,930
to the death.

149
00:07:52,970 --> 00:07:54,520
[RHYNO] A brilliant plan!

150
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:56,940
We'll join forces
to overcome this trial

151
00:07:56,980 --> 00:07:59,310
for the greater good.
It would kill me

152
00:07:59,350 --> 00:08:00,440
to disappoint you.

153
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:01,520
My whole world

154
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,320
would suddenly be devoid
of meaning.

155
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:06,360
Stop being so creepy.
Or at least try.

156
00:08:11,740 --> 00:08:12,870
[RHYNO] Well, then.

157
00:08:12,910 --> 00:08:14,080
[people gasp]

158
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:17,500
[RHYNO] Come!
Let us forge a bond

159
00:08:17,540 --> 00:08:19,620
in the embers
of courage and duty.

160
00:08:20,130 --> 00:08:22,540
We'll fight side by side.

161
00:08:22,590 --> 00:08:25,960
And risk everything
for the sake of humanity!

162
00:08:26,550 --> 00:08:28,630
Well? Unexpected.

163
00:08:29,180 --> 00:08:30,890
That dragoon
must be a nimble rider

164
00:08:30,930 --> 00:08:32,470
to outfly my barrage.

165
00:08:33,100 --> 00:08:35,390
We can't afford
to have that pesky dragon

166
00:08:35,430 --> 00:08:37,560
flying around, causing trouble.

167
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:38,850
So, Iron Whale,

168
00:08:38,890 --> 00:08:41,100
can you rid us
of our little problem?

169
00:08:41,150 --> 00:08:43,060
[WHALE] I can.
But only if you take care

170
00:08:43,110 --> 00:08:44,360
of the ones on foot.

171
00:08:44,730 --> 00:08:47,610
Artillery and close-range combat
don't mix.

172
00:08:48,570 --> 00:08:51,450
And you? Planning to take
on the goddess killer?

173
00:08:51,910 --> 00:08:54,030
Yes. He's quite powerful.

174
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:55,830
A foe worthy of my respect.

175
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:59,410
[WHALE] You're an unusual one,
aren't you?

176
00:08:59,460 --> 00:09:01,080
I expected you
Demon Blight freaks

177
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:03,420
to be a lot colder
and more savage.

178
00:09:05,590 --> 00:09:07,710
[BOOJUM] That is true
of many of us.

179
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:09,420
But I am not one of them.

180
00:09:10,050 --> 00:09:11,930
I bear no hatred towards humans.

181
00:09:12,510 --> 00:09:15,350
Their impending doom
makes them that much more worthy

182
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:16,930
of my respect and pity.

183
00:09:17,390 --> 00:09:19,180
-[explosion]
-[BOOJUM] That is one thing

184
00:09:19,230 --> 00:09:21,940
I dislike
about Spriggan’s methodology.

185
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:24,310
The complete lack of respect.

186
00:09:25,150 --> 00:09:27,730
It has become apparent
that the only one who truly

187
00:09:27,780 --> 00:09:30,200
appreciates my perspective
is my king.

188
00:09:31,030 --> 00:09:32,360
[WHALE] Your king?

189
00:09:32,410 --> 00:09:34,740
So even Demon Lords have lords.

190
00:09:34,780 --> 00:09:35,910
[BOOJUM] Hmm.

191
00:09:35,950 --> 00:09:38,370
Ah, I've said too much.

192
00:09:38,410 --> 00:09:40,410
This conversation is over.

193
00:09:40,460 --> 00:09:41,830
-[metal rattles]
-[Whale laughs]

194
00:09:41,870 --> 00:09:43,620
I wouldn't dream of prying.

195
00:09:43,670 --> 00:09:45,790
In my business,
people who know too much

196
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:47,920
are the first
on the chopping block.

197
00:09:51,930 --> 00:09:53,890
[BOOJUM] The goddess killer
is approaching.

198
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:57,970
I have a particular fondness
for humans like him.

199
00:09:59,310 --> 00:10:01,310
But I must kill him.

200
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:04,100
Everything I do

201
00:10:04,690 --> 00:10:05,980
is for my king.

202
00:10:10,490 --> 00:10:11,570
[footsteps approaching]

203
00:10:11,610 --> 00:10:13,070
[RAJIT] Captain Kivia.

204
00:10:13,530 --> 00:10:16,070
We secured the area
around the government buildings.

205
00:10:16,530 --> 00:10:18,660
So what
should we prioritize next?

206
00:10:20,750 --> 00:10:21,910
Huh.

207
00:10:22,290 --> 00:10:23,960
Captain Kivia?

208
00:10:25,460 --> 00:10:26,630
[KIVIA] New plan.

209
00:10:26,670 --> 00:10:29,050
I need you three
to handle things here.

210
00:10:29,090 --> 00:10:30,170
[RAJIT] Hmm?

211
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:33,090
[KIVIA] I have
some important business

212
00:10:33,130 --> 00:10:34,220
to tend to.

213
00:10:35,260 --> 00:10:36,680
[RAJIT] Hmm.

214
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:38,810
I'm sorry.

215
00:10:38,850 --> 00:10:40,350
That's all I can tell you.

216
00:10:40,390 --> 00:10:42,390
-[RAJIT] I understand.
-[gasps softly] Huh.

217
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:44,850
[RAJIT] I pledged
to serve my captain

218
00:10:44,890 --> 00:10:47,060
to the bitter end,
come what may.

219
00:10:49,650 --> 00:10:52,150
The odds were against us
at Couvenge as well.

220
00:10:52,820 --> 00:10:55,740
And don't forget, you're the one
who taught me how to fight.

221
00:10:55,780 --> 00:10:57,700
So my sword is yours.

222
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:59,410
[Kivia gasps softly]

223
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:02,450
[RAJIT] I'll return to my post.

224
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,870
-Hey, Rajit.
-Yes?

225
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:10,040
Listen.

226
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:12,510
In case something happens to me,

227
00:11:13,340 --> 00:11:15,300
there's something
you need to know.

228
00:11:17,970 --> 00:11:19,350
[rumbling]

229
00:11:23,060 --> 00:11:25,440
[RHYNO] Comrade Xylo,
I'm in position.

230
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:27,770
[XYLO] Those people
had better still be alive.

231
00:11:27,810 --> 00:11:29,270
[RHYNO] Alive and kicking.

232
00:11:29,310 --> 00:11:31,190
Everything is going beautifully.

233
00:11:31,230 --> 00:11:33,280
Comrade Tatsuya
is in his element.

234
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:34,990
[♪ heroic music playing]

235
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:37,360
[RHYNO] I didn't know
he was adept

236
00:11:37,410 --> 00:11:38,990
at using lightning staves.

237
00:11:40,410 --> 00:11:41,580
We should be grateful

238
00:11:41,620 --> 00:11:44,290
someone as competent
as him is on our side.

239
00:11:45,040 --> 00:11:47,710
We owe that man a debt
of gratitude.

240
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:49,580
[XYLO] Venetim! Is Tsav ready?

241
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:51,380
[VENETIM]
There's been a slight delay

242
00:11:51,420 --> 00:11:54,050
on that front. But speaking of,
you should know

243
00:11:54,090 --> 00:11:56,300
the faeries have reached
the inland district.

244
00:11:56,340 --> 00:11:57,430
[Xylo grunts]

245
00:11:57,880 --> 00:11:59,840
Teoritta, are you ready?

246
00:11:59,890 --> 00:12:03,180
Yes. Let us fight
for all of humanity.

247
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:04,890
[Xylo scoffs] You realize

248
00:12:04,930 --> 00:12:06,690
we could both die
in this battle?

249
00:12:06,730 --> 00:12:07,810
And you're not a hero.

250
00:12:07,940 --> 00:12:10,650
So if you fall,
you won't be coming back!

251
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:16,030
Each of your deaths
demands a heavy toll.

252
00:12:16,070 --> 00:12:18,070
The loss
of more precious memories.

253
00:12:18,860 --> 00:12:20,490
And I will not allow it.

254
00:12:20,530 --> 00:12:22,780
I need
to safeguard those treasures.

255
00:12:23,330 --> 00:12:26,200
You need only concern yourself
with protecting my life.

256
00:12:26,790 --> 00:12:27,750
[scoffs]

257
00:12:27,790 --> 00:12:29,080
Nothing could be more asinine

258
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:31,380
than risking your life
for someone else's.

259
00:12:32,040 --> 00:12:34,500
Regardless, it's a deal!

260
00:12:35,170 --> 00:12:36,960
[growling]

261
00:12:37,010 --> 00:12:38,800
[XYLO] Let's win this thing!

262
00:12:39,510 --> 00:12:40,970
[whoosh]

263
00:12:42,300 --> 00:12:45,720
We'll wrap up before morning
and celebrate over breakfast.

264
00:12:45,760 --> 00:12:48,100
Zeff butter
on some freshly baked bread.

265
00:12:48,140 --> 00:12:50,060
With a hot bowl of onion soup

266
00:12:50,100 --> 00:12:51,560
and a side of crispy bacon.

267
00:12:52,110 --> 00:12:53,940
[XYLO] You goddesses
certainly have a knack

268
00:12:53,980 --> 00:12:55,150
for motivation.

269
00:12:55,190 --> 00:12:56,820
Now I'm hungry as hell!

270
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:02,410
[roars]

271
00:13:02,870 --> 00:13:03,950
Don't worry.

272
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:05,990
You're much faster
than those stupid shells.

273
00:13:06,450 --> 00:13:07,660
They won't hit you!

274
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:11,580
The hell are you waiting for?
An invite?

275
00:13:12,790 --> 00:13:13,880
[Xylo grunts]

276
00:13:14,500 --> 00:13:15,630
[XYLO] Seriously?

277
00:13:16,380 --> 00:13:17,510
[faeries shrieking]

278
00:13:17,550 --> 00:13:19,050
-[grunts]
-Xylo.

279
00:13:19,630 --> 00:13:21,590
-What shall we do?
-Forge ahead.

280
00:13:22,430 --> 00:13:25,510
There's no other path.
Cut them down!

281
00:13:27,060 --> 00:13:29,020
[♪ dramatic music playing]

282
00:13:33,940 --> 00:13:36,020
[grunts] Here we go!

283
00:13:37,610 --> 00:13:38,860
[TEORITTA] Rain of blades!

284
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:41,450
[shattering]

285
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:47,120
Teoritta, don't let up! [grunts]

286
00:13:48,750 --> 00:13:49,790
[grunts]

287
00:13:50,250 --> 00:13:51,670
[SHIJI BAU] Don't be stubborn.

288
00:13:52,920 --> 00:13:54,130
[Xylo gasps]

289
00:13:56,250 --> 00:13:58,210
-My knight.
-I've got this.

290
00:13:58,250 --> 00:14:00,720
Hey, that
was a pretty nasty trick!

291
00:14:00,760 --> 00:14:03,340
That's what I was hired for.
[grunts]

292
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:07,100
This time I won't hold back!

293
00:14:07,470 --> 00:14:08,930
[swords clink]

294
00:14:09,680 --> 00:14:10,930
-[Xylo grunts]
-[Teoritta gasps]

295
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:15,060
Iron Whale, a little backup,
but you'd better not hit me.

296
00:14:15,100 --> 00:14:17,690
[WHALE] Honestly,
it's always something with you!

297
00:14:18,860 --> 00:14:20,610
[TEORITTA] My knight, allow me.

298
00:14:23,990 --> 00:14:25,950
[grunts] She's gone?

299
00:14:27,070 --> 00:14:28,240
[Shiji Bau grunts]

300
00:14:31,330 --> 00:14:32,500
[grunts]

301
00:14:32,910 --> 00:14:36,250
-Die!
-Teoritta! Do it now!

302
00:14:38,130 --> 00:14:39,500
[Shiji Bau gasps]

303
00:14:39,550 --> 00:14:41,920
[yells fiercely]

304
00:14:42,380 --> 00:14:43,880
[Shiji Bau gasps]

305
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:45,590
Jayce, are you ready?

306
00:14:46,930 --> 00:14:49,850
Always. Looks
like an easy victory.

307
00:14:49,890 --> 00:14:50,930
[grunts]

308
00:14:50,970 --> 00:14:52,350
[JAYCE] Neely!

309
00:14:53,020 --> 00:14:54,640
[Neely growls]

310
00:14:54,690 --> 00:14:56,440
[XYLO] Say goodbye!

311
00:14:56,940 --> 00:14:59,360
[screams]

312
00:15:04,400 --> 00:15:05,990
[WHALE] Damn.
That's what happens

313
00:15:06,030 --> 00:15:07,160
when I'm distracted!

314
00:15:07,820 --> 00:15:10,280
[XYLO] Rhyno, have you locked
on to the target?

315
00:15:10,790 --> 00:15:11,910
[RHYNO] But of course.

316
00:15:12,450 --> 00:15:16,370
My calculations are complete
and my target is distracted.

317
00:15:17,790 --> 00:15:19,210
Havoc time.

318
00:15:22,090 --> 00:15:23,800
[Whale gasps] Artillery?

319
00:15:29,010 --> 00:15:30,180
That doesn't make sense!

320
00:15:33,060 --> 00:15:34,930
This is beyond artillery!

321
00:15:34,980 --> 00:15:36,350
-How could they--
-[explosion]

322
00:15:40,230 --> 00:15:42,440
[Venetim whimpers]

323
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:45,700
That's going to be a tough one
to explain.

324
00:15:46,700 --> 00:15:48,740
My goodness. The tower.

325
00:15:48,780 --> 00:15:50,160
I know. That was the plan.

326
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:51,790
-Hmm.
-[XYLO] Let's fly.

327
00:15:56,960 --> 00:15:58,290
[BOOJUM] There you are.

328
00:16:05,550 --> 00:16:08,050
[FRENCI] That's twice now
you've sought my help.

329
00:16:09,760 --> 00:16:12,260
Treating a night-gaunt
as your personal spy.

330
00:16:12,850 --> 00:16:14,140
It is uncouth.

331
00:16:14,560 --> 00:16:15,890
Besides, my hands are full

332
00:16:15,930 --> 00:16:17,810
with the search
for Demon Lord Spriggan.

333
00:16:18,190 --> 00:16:20,730
I don't have time
to explore other options.

334
00:16:21,190 --> 00:16:22,400
Help me!

335
00:16:23,150 --> 00:16:24,690
I'll pay any price.

336
00:16:24,730 --> 00:16:26,240
And the moment
I discover the truth--

337
00:16:26,280 --> 00:16:27,650
-[FRENCI] Consider it done.
-[Kivia gasps]

338
00:16:28,990 --> 00:16:30,280
Huh.

339
00:16:30,950 --> 00:16:32,950
[FRENCI] I will have
your answers by morning.

340
00:16:33,790 --> 00:16:34,950
Oh.

341
00:16:35,830 --> 00:16:36,960
I'm grateful.

342
00:16:37,750 --> 00:16:39,330
It is for Xylo's sake,

343
00:16:39,750 --> 00:16:42,210
as he will soon join
the Mastibolt family.

344
00:16:45,760 --> 00:16:47,090
And for me.

345
00:16:47,590 --> 00:16:50,220
A captain of the Holy Knights
owes me a favor now.

346
00:16:50,260 --> 00:16:52,140
That will surely come in handy.

347
00:16:53,510 --> 00:16:54,640
Farewell.

348
00:16:56,810 --> 00:16:58,350
[footsteps receding]

349
00:16:59,770 --> 00:17:01,860
[♪ tense music playing]

350
00:17:02,810 --> 00:17:05,360
Stand strong and fire!

351
00:17:06,360 --> 00:17:07,650
[faeries shrieking]

352
00:17:07,690 --> 00:17:08,650
Don’t relent!

353
00:17:08,700 --> 00:17:09,780
-[DOTTA] Majesty!
-Fire!

354
00:17:09,820 --> 00:17:10,860
[DOTTA] Incoming!

355
00:17:10,910 --> 00:17:13,870
A bogie horde this time.
A huge one!

356
00:17:13,910 --> 00:17:16,080
Might be a good idea to retreat?

357
00:17:16,120 --> 00:17:17,450
-No retreat!
-[gasps]

358
00:17:17,500 --> 00:17:19,370
[NORGALLE] Take one step
from your watchtower

359
00:17:19,410 --> 00:17:20,750
and I will hang you for treason!

360
00:17:20,790 --> 00:17:21,790
[sighs]

361
00:17:22,040 --> 00:17:23,670
[NORGALLE] Put
that superior vision to work.

362
00:17:24,080 --> 00:17:27,210
That is why I entrusted you
with Tsav's lightning stave!

363
00:17:27,250 --> 00:17:28,340
[Dotta grunts]

364
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,840
That thing's way too big
and clunky!

365
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:33,340
The least you can do
is hold your position.

366
00:17:33,850 --> 00:17:35,560
Tsav will be here shortly.

367
00:17:35,600 --> 00:17:37,930
[DOTTA] How do you know
if he's really coming, though?

368
00:17:37,970 --> 00:17:40,390
- I wouldn't if I were him.
-Silence!

369
00:17:40,940 --> 00:17:42,520
He may be a lonely villain,

370
00:17:42,560 --> 00:17:45,820
but even he
is above fleeing from battle.

371
00:17:45,860 --> 00:17:47,570
Wait. That makes it sound

372
00:17:47,610 --> 00:17:49,150
like you think
I'm a worse kind of villain

373
00:17:49,190 --> 00:17:51,360
-than he is.
-[NORGALLE] There was a time

374
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:52,660
- when I believed you were.
-Huh?

375
00:17:53,160 --> 00:17:55,320
But I've been told that despite
all your foolishness,

376
00:17:55,370 --> 00:17:57,620
you have been known
to make miracles happen.

377
00:17:57,660 --> 00:18:00,330
Such was the report
of my commander in chief.

378
00:18:00,830 --> 00:18:03,000
Hold out,
and victory will be ours.

379
00:18:03,040 --> 00:18:05,210
As the king,
it is my sacred duty

380
00:18:05,250 --> 00:18:08,300
to choose worthy retainers
and trust them implicitly.

381
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:17,600
-[whoosh]
-[Xylo grunts]

382
00:18:18,310 --> 00:18:19,720
[XYLO] Take that!

383
00:18:25,810 --> 00:18:28,570
[BOOJUM] Your reaction speed
is truly incredible.

384
00:18:29,530 --> 00:18:32,700
You're exceeding
my expectations,

385
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:34,990
Xylo Forbartz.

386
00:18:35,660 --> 00:18:37,910
[♪ dramatic music playing]

387
00:18:39,120 --> 00:18:40,200
That's blood.

388
00:18:40,700 --> 00:18:44,330
[BOOJUM] You've proven yourself
to be a formidable opponent.

389
00:18:46,290 --> 00:18:48,540
But if there's even
the slightest chance

390
00:18:48,590 --> 00:18:50,960
I'm able to slay
that goddess of yours,

391
00:18:51,710 --> 00:18:54,130
I have to at least try.

392
00:18:54,170 --> 00:18:55,510
Right?

393
00:18:55,550 --> 00:18:56,640
[Xylo grunts]

394
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:58,930
[♪ tense music playing]

395
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:00,810
[Xylo grunts]

396
00:19:04,140 --> 00:19:05,980
Great. Can't get close.

397
00:19:06,020 --> 00:19:08,060
Jayce, little help?

398
00:19:08,110 --> 00:19:10,020
[JAYCE] I can't see my target
through the splattered blood

399
00:19:10,070 --> 00:19:11,360
and dust.

400
00:19:11,900 --> 00:19:14,030
Unless you don't mind us
frying you guys, too.

401
00:19:15,110 --> 00:19:16,910
Of course I mind! [grunts]

402
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:20,240
Rhyno, what are you waiting for?

403
00:19:20,280 --> 00:19:21,580
Start firing!

404
00:19:22,080 --> 00:19:25,160
[RHYNO] I'm afraid my line
of sight is obstructed as well.

405
00:19:25,210 --> 00:19:26,750
I'll have to recalculate.

406
00:19:26,790 --> 00:19:28,840
But don't worry yourself.

407
00:19:28,880 --> 00:19:31,050
The tower will fall soon enough.

408
00:19:31,090 --> 00:19:33,590
[XYLO] Damn it!
They're completely useless.

409
00:19:35,300 --> 00:19:36,720
We're on our own.

410
00:19:36,760 --> 00:19:38,090
Fine by me.

411
00:19:39,100 --> 00:19:40,640
[grunts]

412
00:19:46,730 --> 00:19:47,770
[both gasp]

413
00:19:47,810 --> 00:19:49,400
[Teoritta exclaims]

414
00:19:54,070 --> 00:19:55,740
-[Xylo grunts]
-[Teoritta exclaims]

415
00:19:56,700 --> 00:19:58,280
To hell with you! [grunts]

416
00:19:59,660 --> 00:20:01,120
No, my knight!

417
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:03,700
[BOOJUM] I see
you've stopped fighting.

418
00:20:03,740 --> 00:20:06,660
Now it's time to die.

419
00:20:07,540 --> 00:20:09,500
The goddess Teoritta.

420
00:20:10,040 --> 00:20:12,210
Of all these lives...

421
00:20:13,630 --> 00:20:18,340
yours is the one
I must extinguish at any cost.

422
00:20:19,550 --> 00:20:20,720
-[Xylo grunts]
-[gasps]

423
00:20:21,220 --> 00:20:22,390
[XYLO] Don't worry.

424
00:20:22,430 --> 00:20:24,220
You think I'd let that happen?

425
00:20:25,520 --> 00:20:27,060
Trust in your knight.

426
00:20:27,100 --> 00:20:29,690
And never doubt
for a moment that we'll prevail!

427
00:20:30,980 --> 00:20:33,690
-[TEORITTA] Hmm.
-[XYLO] Believe I'm invincible

428
00:20:34,230 --> 00:20:35,480
and I will be.

429
00:20:36,030 --> 00:20:38,990
[BOOJUM] Xylo Forbartz!

430
00:20:40,870 --> 00:20:42,870
[♪ dramatic music playing]

431
00:21:00,930 --> 00:21:02,430
[BOOJUM] What's this?

432
00:21:02,470 --> 00:21:03,850
[XYLO] It's over, Boojum.

433
00:21:03,890 --> 00:21:05,640
You lose.

434
00:21:09,810 --> 00:21:11,350
[BOOJUM] A valiant effort.

435
00:21:11,980 --> 00:21:14,770
But I'm afraid you're mistaken.

436
00:21:15,270 --> 00:21:18,780
I'm not finished yet!

437
00:21:21,070 --> 00:21:22,570
[grunts]

438
00:21:22,620 --> 00:21:24,370
-[TEORITTA] You are injured!
-[XYLO] It's nothing.

439
00:21:26,330 --> 00:21:27,410
[grunts]

440
00:21:38,340 --> 00:21:39,760
[XYLO] This feels right.

441
00:21:40,470 --> 00:21:42,590
[♪ dramatic music continues]

442
00:21:47,100 --> 00:21:48,470
I'm fighting...

443
00:21:49,180 --> 00:21:51,480
like I used to in a past life.

444
00:21:53,230 --> 00:21:54,730
[panting]

445
00:21:54,770 --> 00:21:56,230
One more time.

446
00:21:57,900 --> 00:21:59,940
[Xylo pants]

447
00:22:04,360 --> 00:22:05,740
[XYLO] How long
will my body hold up?

448
00:22:05,780 --> 00:22:07,700
How much can she take?
I have to finish this.

449
00:22:07,740 --> 00:22:09,830
Try to read Boojum's movements.
I won't lose.

450
00:22:09,870 --> 00:22:11,290
It's foolish to fight for glory.

451
00:22:11,330 --> 00:22:12,500
I have to save them.

452
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:15,790
This isn't over yet!

453
00:22:17,630 --> 00:22:19,880
I will end you!

454
00:22:19,920 --> 00:22:21,380
[BOOJUM] Magnificent!

455
00:22:21,970 --> 00:22:25,010
[♪ heroic music playing]

456
00:22:28,390 --> 00:22:31,770
[BOOJUM] Brilliant execution,
Xylo Forbartz.

457
00:22:31,810 --> 00:22:33,850
With your skill and courage,

458
00:22:33,890 --> 00:22:37,730
you would have made
a fine subject for an epic poem.

459
00:22:37,770 --> 00:22:40,650
Precisely the kind of work
I enjoy most.

460
00:22:41,280 --> 00:22:42,570
Too bad.

461
00:22:42,610 --> 00:22:44,450
I fear that is also the reason

462
00:22:44,490 --> 00:22:47,870
I must do everything
in my power to destroy you.

463
00:22:47,910 --> 00:22:49,870
Spiraling Blood.

464
00:22:53,960 --> 00:22:55,000
Noble knight,

465
00:22:55,040 --> 00:22:57,670
-you shall not be defeated.
-Agreed!

466
00:23:00,170 --> 00:23:01,460
It is time.

467
00:23:02,130 --> 00:23:03,220
Let us end this.

468
00:23:07,970 --> 00:23:10,140
[XYLO] This
will be the final blow!

469
00:23:11,100 --> 00:23:12,560
Think I can do it?

470
00:23:12,600 --> 00:23:13,770
Naturally.

471
00:23:13,810 --> 00:23:16,020
Your goddess
demands that you prevail.

472
00:23:16,060 --> 00:23:18,110
Break free of your limits!

473
00:23:18,940 --> 00:23:21,360
[grunts] You got it!

474
00:23:22,650 --> 00:23:28,240
[BOOJUM] At the behest
of my king, I must kill!

475
00:23:30,330 --> 00:23:33,200
[yells fiercely]

476
00:23:37,040 --> 00:23:39,380
[BOOJUM] You know
you can't defeat me.

477
00:23:41,800 --> 00:23:43,510
[sword clinking]

478
00:23:43,550 --> 00:23:45,010
[Boojum grunts]

479
00:23:45,050 --> 00:23:46,550
It can't be.

480
00:23:46,590 --> 00:23:49,850
He's wielding
the world-ending Holy Sword!

481
00:23:52,270 --> 00:23:54,020
[yells fiercely]

482
00:23:54,520 --> 00:23:57,140
[TEORITTA] There is nothing
the Holy Sword cannot destroy.

483
00:23:57,190 --> 00:23:58,690
And that includes you.

484
00:23:59,610 --> 00:24:00,690
[sword clinks]

485
00:24:08,200 --> 00:24:09,780
[Xylo pants]

486
00:24:15,540 --> 00:24:17,460
[sizzling]

